+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| [board_release_game_wide_20261025/](board_release_game_wide_20261025/) | `Run-PC.cmd` / `Run-PC-Fullscreen.cmd` | `Run-Board.cmd` | PC模式4自适应宽屏；`Run-PC.ps1 -FixedAspect`保留640×480；板端仍为固定B7路径 |
